{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名清華大學畢業生今年赴英國倫敦大學學院（UCL）攻讀碩士，甫抵埗一個多月，疑遭假冒英國移民局的電訊詐騙，自10月下旬轉出45萬元人民幣。</p><p>事件引發廣泛關注，今天（4日）一早，該學生母親向媒體記者報平安，並在朋友圈發文稱，孩子目前已經安全回家。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.330154+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:42:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:27.180427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.984462+00:00","content_hash":"e1179e3d65760d63025ea02966fc4fd889c36e4e00f9db3d1536daf71d8820f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}